          "comment": "[Playbook] We do not accept multi-year take-or-pay: the annual MarketSite.net Access Fee runs for the full five-year term with no reduction or exit right, and the revenue share is calculated on a deemed minimum of 40 users per Customer rather than actual usage. We have added a 30 days' notice discontinuation right with a pro-rata true-up (no penalty or shortfall charge) and tied the revenue share to actual Authorized Software Users.",
