              "oldText": "MarketSite.net Access Fee: Due upon Software Acceptance, and on each annual anniversary of Software Acceptance thereafter.",
              "newText": "MarketSite.net Access Fee: Due upon Software Acceptance, and on each annual anniversary of Software Acceptance thereafter; provided that Corio may discontinue its access to the MarketSite.net Service upon thirty (30) days' prior written notice to Commerce One, in which case no further annual MarketSite.net Access Fee shall accrue and the parties shall true-up amounts due for access actually provided through the effective date of discontinuation, without penalty, shortfall or termination charge."
